# netlist of sch_feedback.sch, from schnet
part C101 capacitor value 10uF swap 1,2 name feedback.bulk
part J101 bnc value BNC name feedback.out
part R101 resistor value 1k swap 1,2 name feedback.rin
part R102 resistor value 10k swap 1,2 name feedback.rfb
part U101 ti/lmh6609 value LMH6609 pins in+:3,in-:2,out:6,v+:7,v-:4 name feedback.u
net +5V global C101.1 U101.7
net -5V global U101.4
net GND global C101.2 U101.3
net IN global R101.2
net feedback.u.in- R101.1 R102.1 U101.2
net feedback.u.out J101.1 R102.2 U101.6
